From c4108d85efc87fab21bd3c0e181c1fbad35bd3be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 18:24:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ci(test,deploy): retarget dead assets/js/** steps to live
 code
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

test.yml: 'validate' and 'compatibility' jobs globbed assets/js/vr-*.js
and examples/** — both directories were deleted, so 'Validate VR
Modules' exited 1 on every push and every other step scanned nothing.
The real suite already runs via ci.yml (npm test). Deleted both jobs
and kept only the 'security' job, with its secret/eval greps retargeted
from the deleted bundle to src/ + proxy/ (DevTools.js excluded — its
executeCode REPL is a deliberate dev-console feature).

deploy.yml: the Pages build had NO build step and uploaded path '.',
publishing raw source whose bare 'three' specifier cannot resolve —
GitHub Pages has been serving a broken tree. Now runs 'npm run build'
with BASE_PATH=/Qui-Browser/ and uploads ./dist. The test job's dead
assets/js lint/module-count steps are replaced with 'npm run lint'
and a real index.html DOCTYPE check.

Co-Authored-By: うめ <app.shizukutanaka@gmail.com>
